# Local secrets. The candidate sheet's CSV export URL is a capability: anyone
# with it can read the whole tracking sheet, including contact details and the
# subjective columns the site never publishes. CI keeps it as a repo secret;
# keep it out of git here. .env.example is the committed placeholder.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc

